These previous studies presented search strategies that have a specific focus on VR or AI. Thus, we decided to present a practical literature review of intelligent VEs. The focus of attention has been on the integration of AI and VE to obtain greater usability and realism from interfaces, exploring the combination of 3D objects and intelligent entities [9]. In this sense, this work conducts a systematic review using AI methods, especially in the applications of VR. The findings will make it possible for researchers interested in AI methods applied to virtual reality to use systematic literature review.
